{"quest_id": 4436, "name": "船上の銃撃戦", "description": "闇ギルドに従う海賊たちとの\n遠距離戦に勝利せよ！\n＜近距離ユニット出撃不可＞\n神級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv50）", "modifier_notes": ["近距離ユニット出撃不可"], "event": "闇ギルドの召使い", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920056, "map_no": 3638, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 75, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 24, "params": [5], "expression": "IsRearguard();", "expression_human": "it is a ranged unit"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 2, "hp": 15000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 290, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 346, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103616, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 459, "global_id": 458, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 462}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 15000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 450, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 346, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103616, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 463, "global_id": 462, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 65, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 250, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103680, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 464, "global_id": 463, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 464, "spawn_sec": 8}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103680, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 465, "global_id": 464, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099856, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 199, "global_id": 198, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 82}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "海賊", "text": "おい！　てめぇら！\nここは闇ギルドの幹部でここらの海賊を取り仕切る\n黒シャチ海賊団のシマだ！　通行料を払いな！", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "……もちろん通行料っていっても、\nそんな安くねぇぞ。\n船も丸ごと俺らに渡せって意味だっ！", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "貴方達が最近暴れてるという\n海賊団ですね。\n今すぐ乱暴な行いを改めてください。", "face": "lb82169bfb75c"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "ほう。俺らに逆らおうとは、\n見上げた根性だな。面白いじゃねぇか。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "俺らが海の戦いってもんを教えてやるよ。\nもし、万が一、俺らに勝てたら、\n見逃してやるぜ。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "ミネルバ", "text": "王子、気を付けた方がいいわ。\nあいつらは、魔物が復活してからもずっと\nこの海域で活動している実力のある海賊団よ。", "face": "u91"}, {"name": "ミネルバ", "text": "それにここ最近は、さらに力をつけてきてるという\n噂を耳にしたわ。ひょっとしたら、新しいギルド長と\n何か関係があるかもしれないわね。", "face": "u91"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "なにごちゃごちゃ相談してんだ。\n野郎どもかかれ！", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　向かってきます！\nお気を付けください！", "face": "lb82169bfb75c"}]}, {"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "海賊", "text": "キャプテン！\nこれがギルド長からこの間支給してもらった、\n特製の弾丸と火薬でさぁ。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "あれだけ上納金を払ってますから、相当の威力が\nあるに違いないですぜ。ある程度様子見したら、\nそれで一気にケリつけちゃってくだせぇ。", "face": "l996016a29640"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "海賊", "text": "くっそぉ……。海で俺たちが負けるなんて……。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "約束通り、\nこれから一切の海賊行為はやめてくださいね。", "face": "lb82169bfb75c"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "はんっ！　そんな口約束してねぇ！", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "そうですか……。\nではあなた方の船は没収いたします。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "なっ……！", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "海での生き方なら\nあなた方のほうがお詳しいでしょう？\nならば、船がなくとも問題ありません。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "そ、そんな……。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "それが嫌なら、二度と海賊行為はしないと、\nきちんとお誓いください。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "海賊", "text": "は、はい……。", "face": "l996016a29640"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうやら無事に解決したようですね。\nでは、王子、戻りましょうか。"}]}], "active": true}